{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17936,\"date\":\"2026-09-20T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-20T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"top-stories-ios-27-macos-golden-gate-siri-ai-waitlist\",\"title\":\"Top Stories: iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate disponibili, Siri AI in waitlist e altro\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate con Siri AI e nuove funzioni. Siri AI richiede una waitlist, iPhone 18 Pro Max negli USA usa un modem diverso e iCloud+ si amplia in oltre 100 paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/top-stories-2026-09-19-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-09-19\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17880,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T09:25:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T07:25:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-iphone-18-pro-apple-watch-aggiornamento-day-one-richiesto\",\"title\":\"Nuovi iPhone 18 Pro e Apple Watch: aggiornamento “day one” richiesto\",\"excerpt\":\"Chi riceve iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max, Apple Watch Series 12 o Apple Watch Ultra 4 dovrà installare subito un aggiornamento software durante la configurazione.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iOS-27-Feature-Dark-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Feature-Dark\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17825,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-5-hands-on-migliore-cancellazione-rumore-prezzo-basso\",\"title\":\"AirPods 5 in prova: cancellazione del rumore migliore e prezzo più basso\",\"excerpt\":\"Hands-on con AirPods 5: ANC migliorata grazie a nuova architettura acustica, microfoni a basso rumore e prezzo d’ingresso con cancellazione attiva a 129 dollari.\",\"categoryName\":\"Offerte\",\"categorySlug\":\"offerte\",\"categoryId\":501,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/AirPods-5-Hands-On-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-5-Hands-On-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17712,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuovi-accessori-iphone-18-pro-airpods-pro-3-laccetto-polso-custodia-trasparente\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta i nuovi accessori per iPhone 18 Pro e AirPods Pro 3: laccetto da polso e custodia trasparente aggiornata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iPhone 18 Pro e AirPods Pro 3 arrivano nuovi accessori: debutta un laccetto da polso e la custodia trasparente viene aggiornata. Ecco cosa cambia.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-accessori-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-accessori\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17706,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"reminder-airpods-5-senza-cavo-di-ricarica-nella-confezione\",\"title\":\"Reminder: AirPods 5 senza cavo di ricarica nella confezione\",\"excerpt\":\"Per chi preordina AirPods 5: Apple non include nella confezione né un cavo USB‑C né un caricatore. Serve procurarseli a parte in base alla versione scelta.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/AirPods-5-Gradient-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-5-Gradient\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17653,\"date\":\"2026-09-11T16:26:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-11T14:26:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rinnova-accessori-iphone-18-pro-custodie-colori-wrist-strap\",\"title\":\"Apple rinnova gli accessori per iPhone 18 Pro: nuove custodie, colori e un cinturino da polso inedito\",\"excerpt\":\"Tornano le custodie trasparenti con anello MagSafe circolare e arrivano nuove opzioni colore. In più, Apple introduce un Wrist Strap compatibile anche con AirPods Pro 3.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/accessori-apple-iphone-18-pro-768x464.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"accessori-apple-iphone-18-pro\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17635,\"date\":\"2026-09-11T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-11T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-presenta-le-airpods-5-ecco-tutte-le-novita\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta le AirPods 5, ecco tutte le novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple presenta AirPods 5 con cancellazione del rumore migliorata del 50% e qualità audio superiore. Ecco le principali novità annunciate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Apple-AirPods-5-hero-260909_big.jpg.large_2x-768x512.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-AirPods-5-hero-260909_big.jpg.large_2x\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17586,\"date\":\"2026-09-10T11:40:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-09T17:52:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-iphone-duo-prezzi-2000-dollari-lancio-ottobre\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole “iPhone Duo”: prezzi da 2.000 dollari e lancio non prima di ottobre\",\"excerpt\":\"L’iPhone pieghevole potrebbe arrivare con il nome “iPhone Duo”. Prezzo di ingresso da 2.000 dollari (256 GB), fino a circa 3.000 dollari e disponibilità “as early as October”.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iPhone-Ultra-Fold-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-Ultra-Fold-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17569,\"date\":\"2026-09-10T10:56:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-09T17:52:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-turn-10-dieci-anni\",\"title\":\"AirPods Turn 10: i primi auricolari wireless Apple compiono dieci anni\",\"excerpt\":\"Il 7 settembre 2016 Apple presentò i primi AirPods: oggi sono passati 10 anni. Nel frattempo, l’azienda continua a vendere EarPods cablati con connettori 3,5 mm, Lightning e USB-C.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Original-AirPods-iPhone-7-768x437.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Original-AirPods-iPhone-7\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17478,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T11:53:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T09:53:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-iphone-18-pro-anteprima-evento-9-settembre-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra e iPhone 18 Pro: anteprima dell’evento Apple del 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà l’evento “Surprise and Shine” mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Attesi iPhone Ultra pieghevole, iPhone 18 Pro con nuove fotocamere e aggiornamenti su Watch e AirPods.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17429,\"date\":\"2026-09-03T18:50:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-03T16:50:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"quattro-nuovi-modelli-airpods-in-arrivo-quando-arrivera-ognuno\",\"title\":\"Quattro nuovi modelli di AirPods in arrivo: ecco come stimare quando arriverà ciascuno\",\"excerpt\":\"La gamma AirPods di Apple è già ampia, ma le indiscrezioni sui modelli successivi continuano. Facciamo ordine tra i nuovi arrivi e proviamo a stimare le tempistiche per ciascun modello.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/airpods-2027-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-2027\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17388,\"date\":\"2026-09-03T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-03T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-huge-launch-prossima-settimana-evento-9-settembre\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara un “huge launch” la prossima settimana: evento il 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"John Ternus e Greg Joswiak anticipano un grande lancio la prossima settimana. L’evento Apple è fissato per mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 PT.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Surprise-and-Shine-Alt-Angle-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Surprise-and-Shine-Alt-Angle-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17382,\"date\":\"2026-09-02T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-02T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-audio-spaziale-piu-preciso\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: come potrebbero migliorare l’audio spaziale\",\"excerpt\":\"L’ipotesi di AirPods con fotocamere torna al centro: l’obiettivo sarebbe rendere l’audio spaziale più preciso, grazie a nuove capacità di percezione dell’ambiente.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/CDB8ABC8-8319-4BF1-B792-358368C42154-768x432.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"CDB8ABC8-8319-4BF1-B792-358368C42154\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17345,\"date\":\"2026-09-01T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-01T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-audio-spaziale-rilevamento-schermo\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: audio spaziale più preciso grazie al rilevamento dello schermo\",\"excerpt\":\"Codice di macOS Tahoe 26.7 suggerisce che AirPods con fotocamere potrebbero migliorare il spatial audio individuando lo schermo guardato dall’utente e restringendo l’audio alla sorgente corretta.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/AirPods-Pro-4-With-Camera-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-Pro-4-With-Camera-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17325,\"date\":\"2026-08-31T17:33:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-31T15:33:11+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tim-cook-lascia-la-guida-di-apple-dal-1-settembre-ceo-john-ternus\",\"title\":\"Tim Cook lascia la guida di Apple: dal 1° settembre CEO John Ternus\",\"excerpt\":\"Tim Cook si dimette da CEO di Apple il 1° settembre dopo 15 anni al comando. Il testimone passa a John Ternus, che diventa amministratore delegato, mentre Cook resta executive chairman.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Tim-Cook-Apple-Logo-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Tim-Cook-Apple-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17318,\"date\":\"2026-08-31T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-31T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"beyond-iphone-18-pro-airpods-5-settembre-ipad-mini-oled-ottobre\",\"title\":\"Beyond iPhone 18 Pro: AirPods 5 a settembre e iPad mini OLED a ottobre\",\"excerpt\":\"Oltre al possibile iPhone 18 Pro, il calendario Apple 2026 vedrebbe AirPods 5 a settembre e un iPad mini con display OLED ad ottobre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-4-new-new-orange-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-4-new-new-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17263,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-event-9-settembre-sei-prodotti-piu-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple Event del 9 settembre: i sei prodotti più attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà un evento il 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Ecco i sei prodotti più probabili: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole, Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4, e AirPods 5.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Surprise-Shine-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Surprise-Shine\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17189,\"date\":\"2026-08-25T12:17:31+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-25T10:17:31+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-5-due-modelli-9-settembre\",\"title\":\"AirPods 5 in arrivo: due modelli già dal 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe preparando l’annuncio di due nuovi modelli AirPods 5 già mercoledì 9 settembre. Come per AirPods 4, ci sarebbero versioni con e senza cancellazione attiva del rumore.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-4-new-new-orange-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-4-new-new-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17109,\"date\":\"2026-08-22T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-22T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-firmware-beta-9a5347a-airpods-modelli-chip-h2\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia il firmware beta 9A5347a per le AirPods: ecco i modelli con chip H2\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile un nuovo firmware beta per AirPods, identificato dalla build 9A5347a. L’aggiornamento interessa solo i modelli con chip H2.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-beta-firmware-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-beta-firmware\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17075,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera-niente-lancio-2026-debutto-fissato-al-2027\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamera, niente lancio nel 2026: debutto fissato al 2027\",\"excerpt\":\"Le AirPods con fotocamera non arriveranno nel 2026: il debutto resta fissato al 2027. Il rinvio sarebbe legato a un video dimostrativo finito nella Release Candidate di macOS 26.7.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-camera-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-camera-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17059,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-roadmap-apple-iphone-ultra-airpods-fotocamere-robot-da-tavolo-nuovi-mac\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.7 svela la roadmap Apple: iPhone Ultra, AirPods con fotocamere, robot da tavolo e nuovi Mac\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS 26.7 mette in evidenza una roadmap ricca: iPhone Ultra, AirPods con fotocamere, un robot da tavolo, oltre a nuovi Mac e altre novità in arrivo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-roadmap-2026-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-roadmap-2026\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17055,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-rc-indizi-nuovi-prodotti-apple\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.7 RC svela indizi su oltre 10 nuovi prodotti Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel codice di macOS 26.7 Release Candidate compaiono riferimenti a AirPods con fotocamera a infrarossi, iPhone pieghevole, un nuovo hub smart home, MacBook e iPad mini con OLED e un Siri Remote aggiornato per Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17053,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-lancio-rimandato-al-2027-nonostante-il-video-demo\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: lancio rimandato al 2027 nonostante il video demo\",\"excerpt\":\"Le AirPods con fotocamere non arriveranno nel 2026: Apple le avrebbe pianificate per il 2027, dopo problemi di supply chain e software. Le immagini demo non cambiano i tempi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-pro-3-peach-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-peach\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17013,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-video-nascosto-macos-tahoe-26-7\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: il leak arriva da Apple con un video nascosto in macOS Tahoe 26.7\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 compare un breve video nascosto che mostra la Visual Intelligence in funzione su AirPods con fotocamere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-con-fotocamera-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16979,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera-prime-conferme-visual-intelligence\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamera: prime conferme e demo con Visual Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta lavorando a AirPods dotati di fotocamera. Una demo collegata a macOS Tahoe 26.7 RC mostra Visual Intelligence, Siri e avvisi per la copertura della camera.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-camera-airpods-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-camera-airpods\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16958,\"date\":\"2026-08-16T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-16T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-30-nuove-funzioni-iphone-siri-contestuale-foto\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: 30 nuove funzioni per iPhone, tra Siri contestuale e foto potenziate\",\"excerpt\":\"iOS 27 arriverà a settembre: ecco le principali novità per iPhone, tra Siri più contestuale, organizzazione intelligente di Safari, funzioni avanzate in Foto e nuove opzioni in Wallet, Maps e Accessibilità.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Everything-New-Your-iPhone-Can-Do-on-iOS-27-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-New-Your-iPhone-Can-Do-on-iOS-27-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16908,\"date\":\"2026-08-12T11:42:13+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-12T09:42:13+00:00\",\"slug\":\"samsung-accelera-udito-galaxy-buds-funzionalita-apparecchio-2026\",\"title\":\"Samsung accelera sull’udito: Galaxy Buds con funzionalità da apparecchio entro il 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"La funzione “Galaxy Buds Hearing Aid” ottiene il via libera della FDA statunitense: l’arrivo delle capacità da apparecchio è previsto nel quarto trimestre 2026, con test dell’udito e regolazione automatica.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/samsung-galaxy-buds-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"samsung-galaxy-buds-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16829,\"date\":\"2026-08-08T19:50:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-08T17:50:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"top-s